  "subject": "A grandmother sews a little bag from each grandchild's outgrown shirt to cover every young loofah on her trellis against fruit flies, so the garden ends up wearing the whole family.",
  "caption": "Old-time acoustic string-band folk in the Appalachian tradition, sung in Taiwanese Hokkien. Clawhammer banjo with a bouncing frailing pattern, old-time fiddle playing the melody in unison and drone, upright bass on the downbeats, washboard brushed on the offbeats. Dry front-porch room sound with natural air and no polish. Male vocal, warm relaxed mid register, easy storytelling delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 104 BPM, A major. Warm, homey, lightly funny mood. No drum kit, no electric guitar, no synth, no autotune, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n阿嬤的菜瓜棚，攀佇後壁牆\n菜瓜幼幼仔，蠅仔攏愛來\n伊就用針線，縫一个一个袋\n共每一條菜瓜，穿一領衫\n[Pre-Chorus]\n彼領藍的，是阮小弟的\n彼領格仔，是我的\n[Chorus]\n菜瓜穿衫，袋仔搖搖\n規棚攏是阮兜的人\n阿嬤講：「穿較煖，生較大條」\n菜瓜無嫌，蠅仔嘛毋敢停\n[Verse]\n黃的是阿姊細漢彼領，補三塊布\n白的是我國小，領仔猶有墨水\n阿爸的汗衫，縫做一个大袋\n裝一條最肥的，掛佇棚仔尾\n[Pre-Chorus]\n人客來看，笑甲掩喙\n問阿嬤：「這是時裝展？」\n[Chorus]\n菜瓜穿衫，袋仔搖搖\n規棚攏是阮兜的人\n阿嬤講：「穿較煖，生較大條」\n菜瓜無嫌，毋驚風吹日曝\n[Verse]\n採收彼工，阿嬤逐條拆衫\n共衫仔洗清氣，晾佇圍牆\n菜瓜煮湯，袂輸過年的菜\n[Bridge]\n一領，兩領，三領\n阮兜的人，攏佇園仔內\n[Chorus]\n菜瓜穿衫，袋仔搖搖\n衫仔掛佇棚仔，替阮顧家\n阿嬤講：「明年閣縫，閣較濟」\n我講：「這回，我嘛來縫」\n[Outro]\n菜瓜穿衫，穿到蒂頭\n阿嬤的針，閣踅一輪",
